> **Stack:** language(s), framework(s), database, deployment target.

> **Status:** active / maintenance / deprecated.

## Critical Conventions (do NOT change without team approval)

- **Branch model:** `dev` → `qa` → `main`. Never push directly to any of these.
- **Commit messages:** Conventional Commits (`feat:`/`fix:`/`docs:`/...).
- **AI-authored commits MUST include:** `Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>`
- **Identity:** `git config user.email` MUST be on your org's domain (`<your-domain>`). No personal Gmail, no `*.local`.
- **Tests:** required for every behavior-changing PR (≥20 prod lines = test required).
- **Secrets:** never in source tree. Use your secret manager / GH Actions secrets via OIDC.
- **Migrations:** no `DROP TABLE`/`ALTER ... NOT NULL` without DBA approval label.

## What This Repo Does Differently

