## Hot Spots (be extra careful here)

- **`src/auth/`** — never bypass middleware, never disable MFA "for testing"
- **`migrations/`** — see migration-safety policy
- **`.env.example`** — sample only; real secrets via your secret manager
- **`infra/terraform/`** — `terraform plan` PR comment required before apply

## Don't Do These

- Don't commit `.env`, `*.pem`, `*.key`, `credentials*.json`, `token.pickle`, `*.sqlite*`
- Don't add `try/except: pass` or `catch (_) {}` — handle the error or remove the try
- Don't suggest a package without verifying it exists on the registry (slopsquat defense)
- Don't create new files when the right place is an existing file (search first)
- Don't `git push --force` to any shared branch
- Don't run `--dangerously-skip-permissions` outside a sandboxed container

## When You're Stuck

Run the failing test, read the error, then read the most recent 3 git log entries on the affected file. If still stuck, leave a TODO with `// TODO(claude): <question>` and ship a partial PR for human review.

## attri-dev-kit Gate

This repo is gated by `Attri-Inc/dev-kit` at `.github/workflows/attri-dev-kit.yml`. If a check fails, fix the underlying issue — do not disable the check.
